# Files under test/fixtures/wpt that are ours, not upstream's.
#
# script/vendor_wpt.sh never refreshes these: a refresh would replace them with
# the upstream file of the same name and break the harness. Everything else here
# is upstream at the revision in UPSTREAM_REVISION.

# Upstream's version substitutes ports and hosts through wptserve at request
# time. The single-VM runner serves every path regardless of host, so this is a
# static get_host_info whose distinct hosts and schemes still resolve to the
# same endpoints — enough for the fetch CORS mode checks.
common/get-host-info.sub.js
